Adapted files created in this workspace on 2026-09-10:
  model.py: Python and CasADi forms of the ORCA ODE and original parameters;
    adds fixed-step RK4 integration.
  controller.py: acados optimal-control formulation preserving contour/lag,
    input/increment and progress objective semantics and physical constraints.
    Nonlinear RK4 prediction and acados SQP replace frozen affine prediction
    and the original damped MATLAB QP iteration. Track interpolation, progress
    normalization and runtime corridor parameterization are adapted.
  ../../tests/acados_mpcc/fixtures/generate_matlab_fixture.m: comparison fixture
    generator that evaluates original MATLAB functions without changing their
    source files; temporary private-function wrappers retain their equations.

The external original MATLAB checkout is preserved separately and unmodified.
